  - m_Id: 452623204352
    m_Localized: Magician
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 454640664576
    m_Localized: 'Gain 3 armor for every 10 mana spent.

      

      Each time
      damage is dealt, inflicts 1 stack of Decay on the enemy, up to a maximum of
      5.

      Each stack increases the target''s damage taken by 8%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 587235196928
    m_Localized: Ranger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 589076496384
    m_Localized: 'Gain 1 charge of Tailwind every 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3.

      Each
      charge increases movement speed by 5% and reduces subsequent incoming damage
      by 10%.

      

      Spells increase damage dealt as they travel, up to
      a maximum of 40%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676112498688
    m_Localized: Pyromancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 678616498176
    m_Localized: '25% of damage dealt is restored as health.

      

      Spells
      inflict the Burning effect, which deals an additional 30% of the spell''s damage
      as damage over time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 745016524800
    m_Localized: Keeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 746736189440
    m_Localized: 'When health drops below 70%, gains the Sheriff''s Whiskey buff,
      increasing movement speed by 13% and deferring 65% of damage taken as damage
      over time over 7 seconds.

      

      For each active spell on the field,
      gain a 5% damage increase, up to a maximum of 20%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
